Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  很  亲密{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes. So close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}林区太太  我知道对于我们大家来说  现在都很悲伤{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Mrs. Lynch, I know that this is an emotional and difficult time for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但在事发之前  乔安娜没有给你关于什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But by any chance, did Joanna send any paperwork your way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}任命文件之类的东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...before it happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有  完全没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只盼当初  她晚个几秒钟过街就没事了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Imagine, if she'd just stepped off that curb a few seconds later...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  差个几秒钟  她就还能跟我们在一起{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. Yes, yes, just a few seconds and she'd still be with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她没说到采购助理的事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Nothing about an assistant buyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真的没有  不好意思  我得走了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, I'm sorry. I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}早安{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}苏菲  我猜你还不知道  乔安娜的事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Sophie, I guess you didn't hear about Joanna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我当然知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I sure did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我很兴奋能邀请到摩妮卡加入我们餐厅{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm so excited about having Monica come on board with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}虽然开除艾米里欧主厨  让我觉得非常遗憾{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Although I do feel bad about having fired Chef Emilio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那就像是失去了一个家人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It is like losing a member of the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然  对你们几个来说  真的是失去家人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Of course, that literally is the case for several of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}东尼  卡洛斯  玛莉…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Tony, Carlos, Marie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}请告诉你们的爸爸  我们有多想他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...please tell your father how much we're going to miss him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道摩妮卡对这家店  有许多很棒的点子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Now, I know that Monica has a lot of great ideas for this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然  你们都看过她那篇评论了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, you all read the review. Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以废话不多说了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So without much further ado...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在此向各位介绍本店的新主厨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I present to you our new head chef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只想说只要有热情{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, I just wanna say, uh, that with a pinch of excitement...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}肯吃苦  肯合作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...a dash of hard work, and a dollop of cooperation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们就可以把餐厅搞得更好…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...we can have the recipe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们打算杀我了我吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you going to kill me?{\r}
